WEBVTT

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.750
Here it comes!

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.130
Kiriya, pass!

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.040
Atena!

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.130
Got it!

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.330
Oh my!

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.500
Whoa, she sent it flying.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.790
I know, right?

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.290
Let's give it another go!

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.210
Sounds good!

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.580
Here it comes!

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.420
Whoops!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.330
Dammit. Why are they all so bouncy?!

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.580
Is Koushi into that kind of thing...?

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.460
I knew it.

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:07.420
Shiranai furi o shiteru dake desho?

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:10.330
Hitomi no oku ni honne deteru yo

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:13.330
Dramatic na koi nanka janai

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:16.960
Hotetta karada toketeshimaisou

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:19.920
Hontou wa tereteru dake

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.880
Okufukaku ijirasete yo

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:25.630
Konna fuku kisasechau no

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.580
Kimi dake ni hora dokidoki shiteru

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Aru ga mama nasu ga mama nagasarete

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Glass no mukou nozokikondara

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.420
Tsuyameku sweety na sekai

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:45.920
Mukiatte dakishimete kowareru hodo

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:48.880
Kimi no kodou ga kanjireru kurai

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.250
Soba ni kite hoshii na

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.580
Torokesou na love

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:57.880
Itazura na ai de kimi no koto madowasu no

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.420
Torokesou na love

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:04.170
Shitai koto zenbu suki ni shite kamawanai yo

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:06.880
Yubisaki de nazotte

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:10.290
Amai amai yume misete ageru yo

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:12.920
Kuchibiru o mitsumete

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:16.080
I wanna kiss you motto motto

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:34.500
I couldn't fulfill my duties
as dorm mother back at the inn.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.420
So today, I'm going to serve as
the designated lifeguard.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.330
What's gotten into me lately...?

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:53.750
Miss Atena is a dorm resident,
and she's like a sister to me.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:59.330
I wonder how she feels about the situation...

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:04.130
Mommy, that boy is staring at
a bunch of ladies wearing swimsuits.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.790
Avert your eyes!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.790
Th-this isn't what it looks like!
I just so happened to-!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.080
COME BACK!

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.000
Y'see? He's not paying any attention to me.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:21.080
Makes sense. I mean, his first crush
was on our preschool teacher...

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.080
What was that?!

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.210
Fish...?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.960
I'd better move somewhere else...

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.250
Of all places, why there...?!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.580
Sutea?!

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.210
What's wrong, Koushi?

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.380
I have to help Sutea...!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.580
Are you alright?!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.420
Did you get a leg cramp?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:26.790
I'm fine.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.790
I wasn't drowning or whatever...

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:33.830
Thank God, the fish is gone...

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.670
Sutea!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.710
Sutea says she wasn't drowing or whatever.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.830
Then what happened out there?

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.830
None... of your business!

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:49.670
Koushi was really worried, y'know.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:54.210
He was the first one to notice that something was up.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.210
He lept straight into the water.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.290
Since when can he swim...?

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.830
He can't, but he was frantic.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:07.330
He showed humility by asking me
to save you on his behalf.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.920
But rest assured that I would've
saved you even if he hadn't.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:13.960
Wow...

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.040
So he was paying attention...

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.380
to me, too...

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.580
Really? You never learned to swim, Koushi?

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.880
I'm surprised.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.540
You seem like you can do just about everything.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.500
I-it's, uh, on my to-do list, I guess...

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.210
I can doggy paddle, at least.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:35.830
Who cares whether or not you can swim?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.330
She's right. To be honest, I think it's kind of cute!

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.710
And despite that,
you tried so desperately to rescue Sutea.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.500
Talk about cool!

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:48.330
Sure, but Miss Kiriya was the one
who ended up saving her...

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:52.040
You were the first one to notice
that Sutea was in trouble, right?

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:55.960
You made sure to keep
an eye on her the whole time.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.500
That's pretty amazing.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.710
I'm... gonna go buy something cold to drink.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.130
What the heck is wrong with me...?

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:15.540
Miss Atena was complimenting me, that's all. But...

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.830
It's hot...

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:38.710
Koushi said that he packed these
especially for you, Sutea.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.710
He did...?

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.210
Since we originally planned on
coming to the beach.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.130
He must've put them in the freezer at the inn.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.920
He sure is thoughtful, isn't he?

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:52.170
He knows you like the back of his hand.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.330
The two of you are such good friends.
I'm kinda jealous!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.040
We're not that close...

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.750
Has he always been this way?

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.880
I'd love to hear stories from when
you guys were younger!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:06.670
Kiriya...

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:12.210
When I stayed over at the dorm that one time, I...

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:15.130
said some really weird and mean things to you...

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:20.630
So, um... the fact that you saved me...

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.170
...and the fact that you're willing to talk to me...

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.130
I appreciate it.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.330
Yeah! Of course!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:31.540
Let's chat some more!

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.750
Let go! It's way too hot!

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.420
But you didn't seem to mind earlier...!

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.630
Speaking of which, Sutea...

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:43.000
If you hate the heat so much,
doesn't your hair get annoying?

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:52.500
She says Koushi's first crush was on
their preschool teacher, so...

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:55.580
...at the very least, she wants to
imitate her hairstyle.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.790
You're so precious and innocent!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.330
Cut it out! Don't crowd me!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.000
Oh my...

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.080
Are you alright, Sutea?!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.460
I'll go buy you a snow cone or something!

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:13.460
I ended up at the shop farthest from our spot...

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.580
Seriously, what am I doing...?

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.830
U-um, please let me by...

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.830
Kinda cute, ain'tcha? You alone?

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.170
Why not come for a swim with us?

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:26.130
N-no, thank you!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.210
C'mon, don't be like that.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.580
Please let go of me!

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:35.880
After all that effort... I thought I'd gotten
a little more used to being around men...

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:38.540
But I just... can't do it!

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:41.790
Excuse me.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:46.080
Why would you force a woman into a situation
that she's clearly uncomfortable with?

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.290
Oh yeah. Just like last time...

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.960
He did this once before.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.580
Who's the brat?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.330
Th-this is my brother!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.920
My younger brother!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.920
Your brother...?

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:01.380
Alright, run along.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:04.170
Be a good little boy and butt out, wouldja?

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:07.500
Your older sister will get sad if you spoil her fun.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.330
It's not like you're her boyfriend.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.920
Yeah, exactly.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:14.330
I might not be her boyfriend,
but I am her dorm mother!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.830
Huh...? "Dorm mother"?

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.960
Sorry! I grabbed your arm without thinking!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.080
It's okay.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.080
You're different than the other guys, Koushi.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:37.040
I still find it difficult to interact with
strange men like them...

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.420
But I feel safe when I'm with you.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.500
Almost like you're my family.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.420
What is... this feeling...?

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:52.290
Goodness, what an exciting day!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:54.750
We're going to head outside, okay?

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:55.830
'Kay!

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:02.710
I just told him that I'd protect him,
and yet he ended up protecting me again...

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.000
Sutea?!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.920
I told Kiriya, but I figured I should tell you, too...

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:17.880
Thanks.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:26.080
I've had a bad attitude ever since I first met you,
but you invited me on this trip anyway.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.210
It's fine! That doesn't bother me.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:31.540
I... resented you for no good reason.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:38.710
It wasn't me, Koushi's childhood friend,
who helped him through the darkest time of his life...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:42.460
Oh... She's the same.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:46.210
I wasn't able to help him, either.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:47.210
Huh?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.580
Hiring him as our dorm mother,
making arrangements for him to go to school...

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:57.460
Mineru and Frey were always the ones
who did the most to support Koushi.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:02.920
To be honest, maybe I was feeling
a little frustrated, too.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:05.880
I just selfishly decided to
start acting like his older sister.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.710
I kept thinking I ought to do something for him...

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:15.040
...and this vacation was what I came up with.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.380
You and I are a lot alike.

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:25.250
Hm...

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.040
I must've been overthinking it.

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:33.580
I thought that Atena might have
feelings for Koushi or something.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:35.920
Now I see...

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.790
His big sister, huh?

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.630
Oh Koushi~

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:02.580
Good morning!

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.920
M-Miss Frey?!

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.250
Please don't say my name all weird!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.500
Uh-oh...

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.830
Wh-what's the matter?!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.040
The pot. It's boiling over.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:24.920
This is delicious, Koushi!

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:27.880
Koushi...?

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:29.540
Oh. Thanks...

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.000
I'll help you with the dishes.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.210
It's fine.

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.040
But-

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:40.170
There's no need. It's part of my job.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.130
O-okay...

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.830
Koushi's been acting strange lately?

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:51.960
Yes. He's not quite as chipper as usual.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.750
He does seem sort of distracted, doesn't he?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:58.250
And he's been that way ever since
we came back from our trip.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.750
The trip...

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.460
Did something happen to him?

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.630
Even if it did, I'm not so sure that he'd tell us...

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.210
Good point...

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:07.290
Alright!

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.040
I've got just the thing!

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.210
Hiya, Koushi.

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.920
If you don't mind,
there's somewhere I'd like to take you.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:34.500
Uh... Sure.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:35.960
Fine by me.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.880
Okie-dokie, let's get going!

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:45.040
When you need a change of pace
and want to express your inner self,

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:47.170
there's no better way than cosplay!

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.420
Hello there!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:54.460
Welcome to our humble cosplay studio, Copu Star-!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:55.580
Oh my goodness.

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:56.830
It's you, Frey.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.630
Do you have a slot open, ma'am?

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:00.580
You'll have it all to yourselves.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.540
What perfect timing!

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.750
I brought a cosplay newbie with me today.

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.330
Are you talking about me?!

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:09.040
Don't worry. I'm going to cosplay, too.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.380
Uh, that's not-

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:12.500
Besides, you're not a total newbie.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.170
You posed as a girl, and you even turned into a cat!

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:17.080
Okay, but do those really count?!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.000
Really?! I need details!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.000
Hold on a sec. I have pictures of his outfit!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.790
But why do you have them?!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.170
Wait a minute... I can't do this!

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:29.330
An amateur like me doesn't belong
in a fancy place like this...

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.580
Oh, you're too kind.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:33.830
And to show this fancy place
the respect that it deserves,

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:37.210
I worked EXTREMELY hard on our costumes!

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:39.710
That includes YOURS, TOO!

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.960
I'd be honored to wear it...

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.380
Thank you.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.920
Does it fit, Koushi?

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:49.540
Well, um...

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.630
I'm having a hard time making
heads or tails of this thing...

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:56.330
Even though you explained it to me... I'm sorry.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.630
Ma'am...

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.250
As the manager, I'm reluctant to
make an exception, but...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.330
...it must be done. Go help him.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.250
Thank you, ma'am!

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:09.290
Hey, missy! Put on some damn clothes first!

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:13.790
Crap... How'd I get stuck in this thing?!

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:14.920
Don't move.

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:17.790
I'll undo it for you.

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:24.330
Let's dress you from the bottom up.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.920
I-I'll do it myself, thanks!

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:33.630
My goodness!

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:38.460
Not bad, you two. You look fabulous!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.830
Miss Frey, where exactly are these costumes from...?

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.130
Well, y'see...

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.880
They're based on characters from one of
the hottest mobile games on the market.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.380
As for the characters themselves...

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.790
Mine is the female commander of a chivalric order,

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:54.540
and yours is a knight belonging to the same order.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.460
They're actually in-laws.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:59.630
Wow... That's pretty interesting.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.540
Oh, and by the way, your character-
the younger brother-

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.630
is in love with my character- the older sister.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:10.500
But the older sister views the younger brother
as family, not as a love interest.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:14.130
Um, Koushi? Is there a reason
why you look so defeated...?

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:15.080
Huh?!

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:17.290
N-n-no, I'm perfectly fine!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.830
L-let's hurry up and start the photo shoot.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.500
Now that I think about it...

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:30.080
It's kind of refreshing to see Miss Frey
without her bangs covering her face...

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.420
'Kay, Koushi. Come over here!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:35.040
O-okay!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.580
W-wait...

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.250
Didn't you say that our characters are allies...?

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.460
There was a time when their goals didn't align,

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:48.630
so they fought with each other
while having a heart-to-heart.

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:53.250
Likewise, I'm going to fire
a bunch of questions at you, Koushi.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:56.830
So I want you to answer them
without holding back!

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.920
Alright, here goes!

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:04.290
Did something happen between you
and someone else on our vacation?

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.080
Wha-?!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.330
N-not really. Nothing important, anyway!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.080
I could've sworn I told you... not to hold back.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.630
Eeeek!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.630
Miss Frey, there's... something different about you.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.460
Of course. Such is...

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:22.580
the nature of cosplay.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:26.130
The Frey who stands before you
is a different person.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.960
In this moment, in this place...

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:32.040
...we can say the things
that our ordinary selves can't.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.380
For whose sake must we show restraint?

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:37.790
Not ourselves, nor anyone else!

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.710
A different person...

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:41.000
Cosplay...

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:44.250
Not ourselves, nor anyone else...

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:51.040
Is that the reason why...
Miss Frey likes to come here?

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:59.460
And if we're going to act different than normal,

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.880
then we may as well be open with each other.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:05.040
Come! Unleash your true feelings, Koushi!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.670
During summer vacation,
when we went to the beach...

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:12.960
some stuff happened, and 'cause of that...

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:18.040
...someone said that they feel safe around me.
That I'm almost like their family.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:21.920
Anyone would be happy to hear that...

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.500
It should've made me happy...

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.250
So why didn't it?

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.960
Even I can't figure it out...

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:42.630
In other words, much like
the character you're cosplaying,

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:47.040
you would prefer for this person
to view you as a man, right?

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.460
There's no way...

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.330
That can't be right!

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:05.880
I mean, a dorm mother who has
feelings like that is suspicious at best.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.380
It's like I'm betraying everyone!

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:12.500
Which is why it doesn't matter what happened.
I'd rather put the whole thing behind me!

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:21.290
Koushi, this isn't the first time
you've said that sort of stuff to us.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.040
"It's 'cause I'm a guy."

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.540
"It's what any decent guy would do."

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:32.580
Don't you see?!

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:36.130
You've been hinting at the fact
that you're a man this whole time!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:39.960
When push comes to shove, are you really
going to sweep everything under the rug?!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:44.920
Have you stopped to consider the possibility
that this misleading behavior of yours

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:49.500
is the reason why there might be certain people
who perceive you as the opposite sex?!

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.670
It can't be...

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.670
Why does it have to be about the opposite sex...?

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.080
The Goddess Dormitory...

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:04.130
I finally found the place where I belong.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:07.920
That's why, lately...

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:11.420
even though I had all these
strange and confusing feelings,

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:13.250
I tried not to think about it.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.540
I wanted to stay at the dorm...

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:20.170
I wanted to stay with you guys,
so I pretended that none of it bothered me!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:23.040
It has nothing to do men and women...

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.330
I just don't want to lose everything!

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:30.500
I just... Is not wanting everyone to hate me
really such a bad thing?!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.750
I'm sorry.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.500
I pushed you a little too hard.

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:42.790
You don't want to damage
the relationships that you've built,

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:46.290
but the shifting feelings in your heart
began to weigh on you.

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:51.460
I'm glad that you told me.

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:54.500
Or perhaps I should say
that I squeezed it out of you.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:56.380
Y'see, I...

00:20:56.380 --> 00:21:00.380
By nature, I tend to be a rather blunt
and outspoken kind of person.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:04.580
And in the past, it led to some mistakes...

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:07.040
I sincerely apologize.

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:10.380
I shouldn't have barged my way into
something so deeply personal.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.880
Nobody in this world wants to be hated.

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:15.250
But, y'know...

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:20.330
Someday, I'd like everyone at the Goddess Dormitory
to see me for who I really am.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.130
Even if we argue or they hate me because of it...

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:26.790
...I won't run from my mistakes
like I did in the past.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:32.460
And maybe then I'll discover a new type of love
that's different from what I'm used to.

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:38.750
Miss Frey.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:44.710
I don't think that I'm...
quite as ready or determined as you are.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:50.500
But... at the very least, I've decided that I want to
be clear and confident about my feelings.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:52.710
If only in my heart.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:57.420
My response to when she told me
that she'd protect me...

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:01.710
Instead of being protected,
I'd rather do the protecting.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:07.330
But whether that's as a dorm mother,
or as a brother, or as a man...

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:09.250
I'm still not sure.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:15.210
Let's go home. Back to our dorm.

